OL,3,GNEWSACause of large church fire
OL,4,Ainconclusive due to damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA joint police and fire investigation
OL,7,Fhas been unable to establish the cause
OL,8,Fof a large fire at a church "due to the
OL,9,Fscale of the damage and risk of
OL,10,Fstructural collapse".
OL,12,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,13,Fit was called to the two-storey Kilburn
OL,14,FMethodist Church in Chapel Street,
OL,15,FKilburn, Derbyshire, at 00:24 BST on
OL,16,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
