OL,3,GNEWSACause of large church fire
OL,4,Ainconclusive due to damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in neighbouring properties
OL,7,Fwere evacuated as a precaution and the
OL,8,Froad was closed while firefighters
OL,9,Fdealt with the blaze. Crews initially
OL,10,Fleft the scene on Friday morning before
OL,11,Freturning to tackle "newly identified
OL,12,Fhotspots, monitor conditions and assist
OL,13,Fthe fire investigation".
OL,15,FFinal crews left the scene at 12:58 and
OL,16,Fhanded over to the building's owner.
